OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas shoeboxes wanted for
OL,4,Aelderly people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that supports older people
OL,7,Fsays it expects demand for its
OL,8,FChristmas shoebox hampers to be "even
OL,9,Fbigger" than last year.
OL,11,FThe appeal, run by Age UK Hull & East
OL,12,FYorkshire, encourages people to fill
OL,13,Fshoeboxes with items that can be
OL,14,Fdonated to those who are lonely,
OL,15,Fisolated, or have no-one to celebrate
OL,16,FChristmas with.
OL,18,FThe charity said it gave out more than
OL,19,F1,200 hampers last year, and would be
OL,20,Faccepting donations until 7 December.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
