OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas shoeboxes wanted for
OL,4,Aelderly people
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorgina Garton, from Age UK Hull &
OL,7,FEast Yorkshire, said: "We want people
OL,8,Fto feel that little bit of Christmas
OL,9,Fmagic. We don't want people to feel
OL,10,Falone, we want people to feel like
OL,11,Fthey're not forgotten about."
